                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>attribution</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> = Acquisition) / # of New Visits Sessions</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
