                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='42' h='1786' id='81' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='4536'>
              <zone fixed-size='152' forceUpdate='true' h='1428' id='84' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='16000' x='1300' y='4715'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>CVR</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1428' id='83' type-v2='text' w='81400' x='17300' y='4715'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'># of Session with </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#6a1b9a' italic='true'>Transaction</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>  / # of Sessions</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='347' h='12679' id='99' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='6322'>
              <zone fixed-size='158' forceUpdate='true' h='12321' id='100' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='16600' x='1300' y='6501'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>mCVR</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>&amp;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>mOCVR</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='12321' id='101' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='80800' x='17900' y='6501'>
                <zone h='1143' id='102' is-scaled='1' param='Image/aaa.JPG' type-v2='bitmap' w='80800' x='17900' y='6501'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='185' forceUpdate='true' h='6892' id='103' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='80800' x='17900' y='7644'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>EXAMPLE</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>A user follows the path below in a session:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>The conversion (taking the order into account) rate of each page is calculated as follows:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>mOCVR1 = 75%           |           3 conversion divided by 4 total page visits</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717'>mOCVR2 = 25%          |           1 conversion divided by 4 total page visits</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c'>mOCVR3 = 0%            |           0 conversion divided by 2 total page visits</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1565c0'>mCVR4 = NULL          |           0 conversion divided by 0 total page visits</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='96' forceUpdate='true' h='4286' id='104' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='80800' x='17900' y='14536'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#616161'>Difference between mOCVR and mCVR</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#616161'>For mCVR, order and total page visits are not taken into account, and for a session the value is measured as Null, 0% or 100%. The calculation is simply based on whether a page and its consecutive page in funnel are visited or not, regardless of the order.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='12' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='173' h='6465' id='105' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='19001'>
              <zone fixed-size='161' h='6107' id='106' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='16900' x='1300' y='19180'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>Funnel</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='6107' id='107' type-v2='text' w='80500' x='18200' y='19180'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>Binary 6-digit system to show visited pages, without taking the event order into account.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>Digits stands for </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>, </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>, </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>, </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#00838f' italic='true'>Add-to-Cart</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>, </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1565c0' italic='true'>Checkout</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> and </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#6a1b9a' italic='true'>Transaction</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> ​in order.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>EXAMPLE</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'>A user follows the path below in a session:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c'>Menu</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717'>List</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>Home</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717'>List</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>Home</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c'>Menu</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#00838f'>Add-to-Cart</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>Home</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'>The funnel for this session is shown as follows:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>1</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717'>1</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c'>1</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#00838f'>1</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1565c0'>0</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#6a1b9a'>0</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='290' h='10357' id='108' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='25466'>
              <zone h='10286' id='109' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='25466'>
                <zone fixed-size='164' h='9928' id='110' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='17200' x='1300' y='25645'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>Time</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#616161' fontsize='12'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>Measures</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='9928' id='111' type-v2='text' w='80200' x='18500' y='25645'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>All time measures in this report refer to average values for given segment.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>Time To Order:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> Time in seconds passed until the first transaction in a session.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>Time [Home, List, Menu, Checkout] :</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> Cumulative time spent in seconds in each main page during a session. Time spent in the mid-steps are added to first previous main pages. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>EXAMPLE : </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b7b7b7' italic='true'>X-Action</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b7b7b7' italic='true'>Y-Page</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b7b7b7' italic='true'>Z-Action</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1565c0' italic='true'>Checkout</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Time spent on </run>
                    <run bold='true'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' italic='true'>X-Action</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  and  </run>
                    <run bold='true' italic='true'>Y-Page</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  will be added to the time spent on  </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  page; time spent on  </run>
                    <run bold='true' italic='true'>Z-Action</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  will be added to time spent on </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> page. In other words, time spent is distributed to main pages, i.e. all the mid-steps are accumulated to the previous main page in the sequence.
</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>IMPORTANT! : </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Please use the time measures together with Funnel segmentation. For example, if you want to know how much time people spend on each main page when they order, you should set </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>Transaction</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> to </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>1</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>. If you want to learn how much time people spend when they do the full funnel, you should set all pages to </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>1</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  with funnel segmentation. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone h='4068' id='82' type-v2='empty' w='98400' x='800' y='95646'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='1050' minheight='1050' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='296' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='99428' id='295' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='286'>
                <zone fixed-size='69' h='2464' id='64' is-fixed='true' name='Data Up to:' w='12300' x='800' y='286'>
                  <layout-cache type-h='fixed' type-w='cell' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2464' id='65' type-v2='text' w='70000' x='13100' y='286'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='22'>Definitions</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='69' h='2464' id='63' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH-LOGO-05.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='16100' x='83100' y='286'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#343b46' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='154' h='1428' id='78' type-v2='text' w='16200' x='1300' y='2929'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>aCVR</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1428' id='79' type-v2='text' w='81200' x='17500' y='2929'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'># of Session with </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#6a1b9a' italic='true'>Transaction</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> (where </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>attribution</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> = Acquisition) / # of New Visits Sessions</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='152' forceUpdate='true' h='1428' id='84' type-v2='text' w='16000' x='1300' y='4715'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>CVR</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1428' id='83' type-v2='text' w='81400' x='17300' y='4715'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'># of Session with </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#6a1b9a' italic='true'>Transaction</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>  / # of Sessions</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='158' forceUpdate='true' h='12321' id='100' type-v2='text' w='16600' x='1300' y='6501'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>mCVR</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>&amp;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>mOCVR</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='24' h='1143' id='102' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/aaa.JPG' type-v2='bitmap' w='80800' x='17900' y='6501'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='185' forceUpdate='true' h='6892' id='103' type-v2='text' w='80800' x='17900' y='7644'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>EXAMPLE</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>A user follows the path below in a session:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>The conversion (taking the order into account) rate of each page is calculated as follows:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>mOCVR1 = 75%           |           3 conversion divided by 4 total page visits</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717'>mOCVR2 = 25%          |           1 conversion divided by 4 total page visits</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c'>mOCVR3 = 0%            |           0 conversion divided by 2 total page visits</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1565c0'>mCVR4 = NULL          |           0 conversion divided by 0 total page visits</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='96' forceUpdate='true' h='4286' id='104' type-v2='text' w='80800' x='17900' y='14536'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#616161'>Difference between mOCVR and mCVR</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#616161'>For mCVR, order and total page visits are not taken into account, and for a session the value is measured as Null, 0% or 100%. The calculation is simply based on whether a page and its consecutive page in funnel are visited or not, regardless of the order.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='161' h='6107' id='106' type-v2='text' w='16900' x='1300' y='19180'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>Funnel</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='6107' id='107' type-v2='text' w='80500' x='18200' y='19180'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>Binary 6-digit system to show visited pages, without taking the event order into account.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>Digits stands for </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00' italic='true'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>, </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>, </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>, </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#00838f' italic='true'>Add-to-Cart</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>, </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1565c0' italic='true'>Checkout</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#6a1b9a' italic='true'>Transaction</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> ​in order.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>EXAMPLE</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>A user follows the path below in a session:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c'>Menu</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>Home</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c'>Menu</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#00838f'>Add-to-Cart</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>Home</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>The funnel for this session is shown as follows:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Æ         </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff8f00'>1</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717'>1</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c'>1</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#00838f'>1</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1565c0'>0</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> - </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#6a1b9a'>0</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='164' h='9928' id='110' type-v2='text' w='17200' x='1300' y='25645'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>Time</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#616161' fontsize='12'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>Measures</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='9928' id='111' type-v2='text' w='80200' x='18500' y='25645'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>All time measures in this report refer to average values for given segment.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>Time To Order:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> Time in seconds passed until the first transaction in a session.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>Time [Home, List, Menu, Checkout] :</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> Cumulative time spent in seconds in each main page during a session. Time spent in the mid-steps are added to first previous main pages. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>EXAMPLE : </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b7b7b7' italic='true'>X-Action</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b7b7b7' italic='true'>Y-Page</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b7b7b7' italic='true'>Z-Action</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'> &gt; </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1565c0' italic='true'>Checkout</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Time spent on </run>
                    <run bold='true'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' italic='true'>X-Action</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  and  </run>
                    <run bold='true' italic='true'>Y-Page</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  will be added to the time spent on  </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#827717' italic='true'>List</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  page; time spent on  </run>
                    <run bold='true' italic='true'>Z-Action</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  will be added to time spent on </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#388e3c' italic='true'>Menu</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> page. In other words, time spent is distributed to main pages, i.e. all the mid-steps are accumulated to the previous main page in the sequence.
</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161'>IMPORTANT! : </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>Please use the time measures together with Funnel segmentation. For example, if you want to know how much time people spend on each main page when they order, you should set </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>Transaction</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'> to </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>1</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>. If you want to learn how much time people spend when they do the full funnel, you should set all pages to </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#616161' italic='true'>1</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#616161'>  with funnel segmentation. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{4822694C-4040-442C-A189-1E9902A75B05}' />
    </dashboard>
